--- SMD (PMF_react_TS1_alpha) ---

Steered MD stage generating the starting configurations for the reactant->TS1 umbrella-
sampling scan (see ../US/README and ../README). MOVINGRESTRAINT pulls 'dD' (the nucleophile-
approach/P-O-bond-cleavage reaction coordinate, pph3 atom numbering) from AT0=-2.0 to
AT1=2.0 over 100000 steps, KAPPA=400 kcal/mol, under background UPPER_WALLS/LOWER_WALLS/
angle restraints preventing metaphosphate formation and keeping the neutralizing Mg2+
engaged (same protocol as pph4's reactant->TS1 SMD, see LFER_3_mg2/pph4/PMF_react_TS1/
SMD_react_TS1/README). Restart snapshots are converted into 'lmp_files/' seed structures for
the umbrella windows.

Three replicas (rep1/2/3) -- one README covers all three.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
